need with both his skills in healing magic and his fighting abilities. He's usually very calm and gentle, but can become passionate in the midst of battle. He can sometimes get melancholic and somber when he thinks about the crimes he has committed in the past and for which he tries to atone.\n\nHe mostly uses his magic to fight but can also fight with a sword, using his magic foci (the four blue weapons) as a mean to fly in the air in his back, like a pair of wings.\n\nI would like the clothes to be the same as in the references. Feel free to include or not his weapons. Please include his tattoo and diadem.\nI leave the composition to you.\n\nReferences : \nhttps://imgur.com/a/2wcDCJU\n\nThank you for your consideration !", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/331b7498/uploads/origins/3fe56f11-2680-4439-ae0a-93c085fd1486?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f93d7c9aa175df7543d035418d905390", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/331b7498/uploads/origins/3fe56f11-2680-4439-ae0a-93c085fd1486?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f93d7c9aa175df7543d035418d905390, https://si.imgix.net/331b7498/uploads/origins/3fe56f11-2680-4439-ae0a-93c085fd1486?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=306215e1638b494eb1f747838284d259 2x, https://si.imgix.net/331b7498/uploads/origins/3fe56f11-2680-4439-ae0a-93c085fd1486?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&