se Daemon. :)\nI'd like it to be a vertical image, beucase I'd like to use it on my schedule image and my twitter avatar.\n\nThe appearance and clothes are as depicted on the reference sheet I will attach.\nShe is very curious of the human world, happy and smug. Her eyes are teal blue, they only turn pink when she turns seductive.\n\nThe background should be related to cherryblossom trees and spring.\nShe would be surprised to see them in bloom and the blossom flowers. Maybe even have some cherry blossoms fall on her head? I'll leave those details to your artistic freedom!\n\nThank you so much, take care and have a nice day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1U1beKRTtt97WnRufYjB91o6esPp7vM80/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1904568, "client_id": 978791, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25c66c9812632eb0685c7699da33c563", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25c66c9812632eb0685c7699da33c563, https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=916bb3224897a9d63301deaddc08f792 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f0e0795dffe06fa40c7ba8e85351af0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11e7260c514ed4a054fdae78a089fabc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11e7260c514ed4a054fdae78a089fabc, https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a13a71102257aa1d444ac8e5d234577 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2975c863/uploads/origins/58c1acff-fda2-497f-83e8-44e25ff3f777?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=283d32e0a6b09ea277d3925949fd6cf4 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Since skeb's on campaign I think it is better to request here. Thanks for your last illustration (PID98627146) and it is one of my favourite. I hope you can consider my request again!\n\nCan you draw my original character? (Basic settings in the previous request.) Please use the outfit in the folder \"デザイン2\": this is his outfit as adventurer in the past. Imagine that he has some \"personal matters\" to deal with unrelated to the academy. Since he doesn't need to hold his identity as a professor for that, I guess he is a bit wilder and more intimidating there.\n\nSince he is so good at magic there is no restriction on how he casts magic at all. E.g. he doesn't always need a wand (like \"1137272-1.output.jpg\" in the ref) or any body posture (so that he can just sit there and magic appears). He can also summon wind sword as well. These are just some of the possibilities, but you can decide how would he looks like. I will leave the everything to you and please draw as you want, thanks!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NQ-dg1Q8t5h1huexZKbtNQ-wvJXo4NuF?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls"