 as Nastume Takashi is wearing in these references: https://imgur.com/a/4NLhGt2 . I want one eye to be visible and a bit of her mouth. She has a smug smile and her finger in front of her mouth in a 'Don't say anything about me' / 'sshhhhh' way. She is undercover so she would like to not be discovered. \n\nThe background could be a traditional Japanese house with the door open and arms trying to suck her into the house. This is only a suggestion so it's up to you how you want to draw the background! :,))\n\nThank you and have a great day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LEpuKLg5xaEncOWGjT3RSPqpJIL7xKsH?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/59c7ab6b/uploads/origins/69a3829b-993a-4dc7-a6d5-d97aa803fd27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ff6570240322a77cb5041e8e5d51be5f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59c7ab6b/uploads/origins/69a3829b-993a-4dc7-a6d5-d97aa803fd27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ff6570240322a77cb5041e8e5d51be5f, https://si.imgix.net/59c7ab6b/uploads/origins/69a3829b-993a-4dc7-a6d5-d97aa803fd27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=50c62072332cf3f0a5d26fe280f2139e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59c7ab6b/uploads/origins/69a3829b-993a-4dc7-a6d5-d97aa803fd27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d0d7f79a21b96f8674235a9ca196356f 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipp