body": "Hello! It's nice to meet you. I saw your artwork on twitter and it was really amazing!\n\nI was hoping you can draw my character as a [原神] [Genshin Impact] character! The pose and costume is up to you! If possible, you can come up with her weapon, and element! I would love to see what you come up with! \n\nIf this request is not okay, please reject and I will send a different request! Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11K7uDw5XGa4IXVlfm9bw-2uHIxQ4oVX9?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1904568, "client_id": 1825060, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e87bf7db61fee5933f91658adb625e6e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e87bf7db61fee5933f91658adb625e6e, https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acbf17cc80ab89f9e243d645fd1a6273 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62b12807b8e8aee51e7a8560bce3c765 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5a8a495310d147d619dfd3b5f9a503c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5a8a495310d147d619dfd3b5f9a503c, https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c579f981d577de6d7b7ea276356f303c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4aaae27/uploads/origins/31112048-a372-4271-8e95-272e11a96cb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc14874fa9f65695c2d6bdc6507b52fe 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I really love your artwork. Your artwork is very unique and cool. If possible, I would love to request a drawing of my original character “Akari”. She has light-purple hair, purple eyes, wears a black-hair ribbon, and is in her early 20s. She is a mercenary. Her personality is stoic and mysterious, but is quite dark and sadistic. \n \nHer composition can be up to you. Please feel free to draw.\n \nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mq1FX2m1yEPkt1RXlvxRc-8S_0yuPNj4?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1904568, "client_id": 2055393, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1cd7ffc93a04cf3a77e73acca3f71b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1cd7ffc93a04cf3a77e73acca3f71b, https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e714171a0837c794287c183cf0f68992 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed1c79375f5e33f2ecf09ba2ffb9057d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5cdc1cdc3fea92d90a510d9306e1ab45", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5cdc1cdc3fea92d90a510d9306e1ab45, https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a62b83ac7b097f3106458c76a2a274e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4b107a39/uploads/origins/a04ea6da-eeff-4b32-aed5-db1cf1fe1882?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eae35442b11135cc366b3d11d636f13e 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I saw the art you did for Shinobu and your art is absolutely beautiful! You are so talented. I was wondering if you could draw my Vtuber character (please include the horns and earrings in the design as well as the claws) floating upside down above a garden. Please make the flowers all gold roses instead of blue. I would like the character to be tied with golden vines with thorns instead of strings. Instead of the planet in the background from the reference, could you make it a blue moon? If possible can you make the art 16:9 (size) 1920*1080 and please separate as many layers as you can? I would use it as a ending soon screen for my Twitch channel or in YouTube Thumbnails. My character is very ethereal and pensive. If it's okay may I have the PSD file too? It's okay if not! \n\nReference pose: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LtcVykBZrgBLR9jbPjOYDC8qXh006o3A/view?usp=drivesdk \n\nGarden reference: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lz2ERSnLf8iNJfWdlP_Bm3Ugb-hb2TEm/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-NJ35jz3kL_QcgD51Tx-vxBbbbfVntDC/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiramigame/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1904568, "client_id": 1022582, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15259e795d1f1695f8ab95363c2d5d2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15259e795d1f1695f8ab95363c2d5d2, https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=980d187d25b0bf5b8dea8ee6f5d47de6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c0e2b6d541c885bdde39bd69e1c4759 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0440ce6b9bebffa9def6028b220dce74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0440ce6b9bebffa9def6028b220dce74, https://si.imgix.net/7184e1ff/uploads/origins/de03cbbb-e7e9-4b09-b37d-f9111541662a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5db4a153c19733d1fc45568d23c51d6 2x